  "notes": "{加工|かこう} means to process or work on raw materials to change their form, quality, or properties. It covers a wide range of activities from industrial manufacturing to digital editing.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Pattern: [material]を{加工|かこう}する\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {食品|しょくひん}{加工|かこう}: food processing\n- {加工|かこう}{品|ひん}: processed product (commonly seen on food labels)\n- {画像|がぞう}{加工|かこう}: image editing/retouching\n- {金属|きんぞく}{加工|かこう}: metalworking\n- {木材|もくざい}{加工|かこう}: woodworking\n- {加工|かこう}{食品|しょくひん}: processed food\n\nMODERN USAGE:\n{画像|がぞう}{加工|かこう} (photo editing/retouching) is increasingly common, especially for social media. {加工|かこう}アプリ refers to photo editing apps.",
